The house-rules plugin adapts text from pstack, by Lauren Tan, at
https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/bf0c7cd80a/pstack (version 0.15.42),
which is distributed under the MIT License below.

- skills/unslop/SKILL.md adapts pstack/skills/unslop/SKILL.md. Its Process
  and Adding soul sections come from an earlier version of the same skill
  that the author kept.
- skills/technical-writing/SKILL.md adapts
  pstack/skills/technical-writing/SKILL.md.

New here: rule 14 is left out of unslop, rule 13 follows the author's own
rule on dashes, rule 17 keeps the heading case a document set already uses,
and the hooks that send prose to the skills and hold a Markdown write until
unslop is loaded.

